            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "## Services",
            "source_lines": [
              5
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "The reservation service accepts requests, a planner assigns intervals, and an instrument gateway executes approved schedules. The calendar displays plans but cannot authorize execution.",
            "source_lines": [
              7
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "## Navigation",
            "source_lines": [
              9
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Read [Transfer](reservations.md#transfer), [Weather](weather.md#suspension), and [Clock](clock.md#clock-offset) for operational details. The calendar's [colours](calendar.md#colours) are display conventions.",
            "source_lines": [
              11
            ]
          }
