          {
            "text": "## Clock offset",
            "source_lines": [
              5
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "If the absolute clock offset exceeds two seconds, pause schedule execution and notify the duty operator. Keep queued reservations unchanged. Resume only after two consecutive reference checks report an offset within two seconds.",
