          },
          {
            "text": "## Missing reference",
            "source_lines": [
              9
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "If the reference clock is unavailable, keep execution paused; a local clock reading alone cannot satisfy either recovery check.",
            "source_lines": [
              11
            ]
          }
