          },
          {
            "text": "## Suspension",
            "source_lines": [
              5
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Suspend outdoor observations when the wind interlock opens. Preserve reservation identifiers during suspension. Resume only after the interlock closes and the duty operator records a restart approval.",
