              7
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "## Indoor instrument",
            "source_lines": [
              9
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "An instrument explicitly classified as indoor may continue during a wind suspension, provided its own safety interlocks remain closed. A roof visible as closed on the calendar does not establish indoor classification.",
